# Area map (pointers only)

Canonical knowledge is in **`.md` files**. Use this table to open the right entry points. Keep this file short — update the linked docs, not this rule.

| Topic | Read first |
| --- | --- |
| Framework entry / index | `README.md`, `README.pt-BR.md`, `docs/en/README.md`, `docs/pt-BR/README.md` |
| Language / bilingual policy | `docs/en/language.md` |
| Style / writing | `docs/en/style-guide.md`, `docs/en/standards.md` |
| Lifecycle / status | `docs/en/lifecycle.md`, `docs/en/change-policy.md` |
| AI agent doc rules | `docs/en/ai-change-rules.md`, `docs/en/ai-documentation-workflow.md`, `docs/en/ai-context.md` |
| Agent entry files (AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md) | `docs/en/ai-agent-entry.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` |
| Architecture methodology | `docs/en/architecture-model.md` |
| Contracts methodology | `docs/en/contract-model.md` |
| Operations / reliability | `docs/en/operations-model.md` |
| Security methodology | `docs/en/security-model.md` |
| Governance / validation | `docs/en/governance.md`, `docs/en/automation-commands.md`, `Makefile` `docs-validate` |
| Documentation debt | `docs/en/documentation-debt.md` |
| Changelog | `docs/en/changelog-policy.md` |
| As-is: Loft infra publish path | `docs/en/loft-infra/README.md` (start: `publish-guide.md`, `examples/`) |
| As-is: Loft Datadog observability | `docs/en/loft-observability/README.md` |
| As-is: AIOps apps | `docs/en/aiops-apps/README.md` |
| Templates | `docs/en/templates/` |
| Examples | `examples/README.md` |
| Optional Confluence publish | `docs-sync/README.md`, `docs/en/publishing-surfaces.md` |
| Cursor / Claude skills | `.cursor/skills/document-after-change/SKILL.md`, `.cursor/skills/grill-me/SKILL.md`, `.claude/skills/` |
| Adopter agent starter | `examples/adopter-agent-starter/` |

pt-BR mirrors live under `docs/pt-BR/` with the same relative paths.

